":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"逐項保存本文子、父、母、弟、兄、娣及妻妾的記載。賤妾不改稱夫人；不以繼位、後裔氏族或私通補親屬。原文生子允承接惠公自妻宋女，並非由攝政或繼位推父子。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji033-021","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_B","title":"釐公","kind":"unclassified","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p047","quote":"於是季友奉子申入，立之，是爲釐公。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji033-021:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p047","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"釐公","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m047-0081","usage":"retrospective"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"來源用稱與授予分開；公號作敘事追稱暫解，不把即位當成當時授予諡號。未知日期及終點不按卒日補造。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji033-057","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_B","surfaces":["子申","申","釐公","魯釐公"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-032-qi","c-shiji-033-lu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p036","quote":"二十七年，魯湣公母曰哀姜，桓公女弟也。哀姜淫於魯公子慶父，慶父弒湣公，哀姜欲立慶父，魯人更立釐公。桓公召哀姜，殺之。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p047","quote":"湣公二年，慶父與哀姜通益甚。哀姜與慶父謀殺湣公而立慶父。慶父使卜齮襲殺湣公於武闈。季友聞之，自陳與湣公弟申如邾，請魯求內之。魯人欲誅慶父。慶父恐，奔莒。於是季友奉子申入，立之，是爲釐公。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p048","quote":"釐公亦莊公少子。哀姜恐，奔邾。季友以賂如莒求慶父，慶父歸，使人殺慶父，慶父請奔，弗聽，乃使大夫奚斯行哭而往。慶父聞奚斯音，乃自殺。齊桓公聞哀姜與慶父亂以危魯，及召之邾而殺之，以其尸歸，戮之魯。魯釐公請而葬之。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p049","quote":"季友母陳女，故亡在陳，陳故佐送季友及子申。季友之將生也，父魯桓公使人卜之，曰：『男也，其名曰「友」，閒于兩社，爲公室輔。季友亡，則魯不昌。』及生，有文在掌曰『友』，遂以名之，號爲成季。其後爲季氏，慶父後爲孟氏也。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p050","quote":"釐公元年，以汶陽鄪封季友。季友爲相。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p051","quote":"九年，晉裏克殺其君奚齊、卓子。齊桓公率釐公討晉亂，至髙梁而還，立晉惠公。十七年，齊桓公卒。二十四年，晉文公即位。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p052","quote":"三十三年，釐公卒，子興立，是爲文公。"}],"rationale":"按懿公被弒至魯文公的敘事角色、同段明示子／弟與柯盟、齊襄公殺魯桓公、晉立惠公等具體事件暫定異稱；同字爵稱依國別分開。公子揮不與前篇公子翚、晉襄父不與晉襄公、宣伯不與叔孫宣伯自動合併。數位疑讀與親屬異說仍待核對。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p036","text":"二十七年，魯湣公母曰哀姜，桓公女弟也。哀姜淫於魯公子慶父，慶父弒湣公，哀姜欲立慶父，魯人更立釐公。桓公召哀姜，殺之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m036-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"魯湣公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m036-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"哀姜","kind":"person","person_id":"tke_fad_hlp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m036-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m036-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"哀姜","kind":"person","person_id":"tke_fad_hlp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m036-0023","start":23,"end":28,"surface":"魯公子慶父","kind":"person","person_id":"k6c_jbs_1gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m036-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"慶父","kind":"person","person_id":"k6c_jbs_1gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m036-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"湣公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m036-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"哀姜","kind":"person","person_id":"tke_fad_hlp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m036-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"慶父","kind":"person","person_id":"k6c_jbs_1gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m036-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"釐公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m036-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m036-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"哀姜","kind":"person","person_id":"tke_fad_hlp","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","book_id":"b-shiji-032","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p047","text":"湣公二年，慶父與哀姜通益甚。哀姜與慶父謀殺湣公而立慶父。慶父使卜齮襲殺湣公於武闈。季友聞之，自陳與湣公弟申如邾，請魯求內之。魯人欲誅慶父。慶父恐，奔莒。於是季友奉子申入，立之，是爲釐公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m047-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"湣公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m047-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"慶父","kind":"person","person_id":"k6c_jbs_1gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m047-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"哀姜","kind":"person","person_id":"tke_fad_hlp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m047-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"哀姜","kind":"person","person_id":"tke_fad_hlp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m047-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"慶父","kind":"person","person_id":"k6c_jbs_1gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m047-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"湣公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m047-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"慶父","kind":"person","person_id":"k6c_jbs_1gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m047-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"慶父","kind":"person","person_id":"k6c_jbs_1gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m047-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"卜齮","kind":"person","person_id":"y38_ic5_9vk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m047-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"湣公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m047-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"季